{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799","label":"oil paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033618","label":"paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/8903","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":"946, Catalogue Raisonné","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"catalogue raisonnée number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026061"}],"content":"946","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"8903","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Red Hill and White Shell","type":"Name"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":{"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"White Shell \u0026 Red Hills – New Mexico","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"White Shell and Red Hills, New Mexico","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"White Shell and Red Hills – New Mexico","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},"selected-exhibition-titles":{"titles":["Red Hills and White Shell\nO'Keeffe and Texas, 1998, McNay Art Museum (San Antonio)"],"type":"selected-exhibition-titles"},"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"Red Hill and White Shell","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Double entries Abiquiú Notebooks. Whitney Archive indicates, \"Note: O'Keeffe told me this ptg. was in the Art Inst. exh. Did not see the picture so couldn't identify by Art. Inst. label.\" Abiquiú Notebooks notes inscription 1. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"An enlarged white spiral shell occupies the center of the frame. A bright red landscape with rolling hills and a red and yellow striped sky fills the frame behind the shell.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Red Hill and White Shell, 1938","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"30 x 36 1/2 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Red Hill and White Shell, 1938. Oil on canvas, 30 x 36 1/2 inches. The Museum of Fine Arts, Houston (MFA H). Gift of Isabel B. Wilson in memory of her mother, Alice Pratt Brown, 91.2027. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"The Museum of Fine Arts, Houston (MFA H)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 30 x 36 1/2 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Gift of Isabel B. Wilson in memory of her mother, Alice Pratt Brown, 91.2027","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"Doris Bry, New York, until 1972; sold to Mrs. George R. Brown (née Alice Pratt), Houston, 1972–1982; given to Isabel B. Wilson, 1982–1991; given to MFAH, 1991.(Source: MFAH, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_post_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_post_1999"}],"content":["In correspondence from Doris Bry to Alice Pratt Brown, November 9, 1972, Bry states “When I go to Abiquiu next week I will ask Miss O’Keeffe to sign a photograph of the painting as authentication for you” (MFAH object files). \nMFAH memorandum from Charles J. Carroll, Registrar to Lorraine Stuart, Museum Archivist, October 18, 1995: \n“Enclosed for deposit in the Archives Artist Correspondence is an original letter from Georgia O’Keeffe, signed, to Mrs. George R. Brown (mother of the donor of this painting), dated November 17, 1972, verifying the authorship of this painting. Also enclosed is the black and white photograph that accompanied this letter. The photograph is also signed on the back by the artist. Per my conversation with Isabel Wilson yesterday, this was done at the time at her mother’s request because the painting itself is not signed” (MFAH object files). \nCorrespondence from Georgia O’Keeffe to Mrs. George R. (Alice Pratt) Brown, November 17, 1972: “Dear Mrs. Brown: This will confirm that the painting RED HILL AND WHITE SHELL, 1938, oil on canvas, 30 x 36”, of which I enclose a signed photograph, is painted by me. Sincerely [signed] Georgia O’Keeffe” (copy of letter in MFAH object files). \n(Source: MFAH, 2025)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/869930/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/869930"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}